  "post_content": "<p>La tarde de este domingo se han entregado en el Teatro M&oacute;naco de Onda los <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=31798\" target=\"_blank\">premios del XLVIII Certamen Literario</a>, cuando se cumple el 50&ordm; aniversario del Ateneo Cultural y Mercantil.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/10/IMG_4031.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Como primera conmemoraci&oacute;n se convoc&oacute; un concurso de logotipos y hoy se ha presentado el dise&ntilde;o ganador, obra de la ondense Mar&iacute;a Jos&eacute; Delgado.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/10/FotoMariaJosePremiLogo.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 229px\" /></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisateneu2012/img_3977.jpg\" alt=\"img_3977\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisateneu2012/img_3978.jpg\" alt=\"img_3978\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisateneu2012/img_3979.jpg\" alt=\"img_3979\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisateneu2012/img_3980.jpg\" alt=\"img_3980\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisateneu2012/img_3981.jpg\" alt=\"img_3981\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisateneu2012/img_3982.jpg\" alt=\"img_3982\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisateneu2012/img_3983.jpg\" alt=\"img_3983\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/